          "text": "Vendor arrangements under FERPA are **fact-specific**. Under the school official exception, an outside party must perform an institutional service or function, meet the school or district’s school-official criteria, remain under the institution’s direct control over use and maintenance, and use records only for authorized purposes without unauthorized redisclosure. The school or district remains responsible for protecting information disclosed under that exception. [2]"
